This licence covers the AtiSim source code, its documentation and the data
this project derived itself. It does NOT cover the third-party reference
documents the project reads, nor the published data digitised from them.

Reference documents are not redistributed here. `Reference_papers/SOURCES.md`
lists every source with its licence basis and a permanent locator, and
`docs/PROJECT.md` §3 names the table behind every number. Data digitised from
US Government works (NASA CR-2144, NASA TM-102186, Parks et al. 1985) carries
no separate restriction; anything read from a publisher-held document is
recorded as a citation rather than reproduced.
